        <briefdescription>
<para>Obtain a reference to the GD32 clock controller. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>There is a single clock controller in the GD32: cctl. The device can be used without checking for it to be ready since it has no initialization code subject to failures. </para>
